      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَنْدَلَ</span></b> , said of a camel, (IAar, M, O, K,)
and of an ass, (K,) <i>He was big in the head,</i>
(IAar, M, O, K,) <i>and hard,</i> or <i>strong,</i> or <i>hardy,
and large.</i> (K.)

